  'lede'  => 'Your own corner of the portal: your leave balance and requests, the leave periods you can join, your program on the Planning board, the trainings you can apply for and your certificates, your annual evaluation, your messages with HR, and the Community — wishes, kudos, the noticeboard and badges. Short, with the steps to follow.',
  'sections' => [
    ['id' => 'start', 'title' => 'Getting in and getting around', 'body' => [
      'Who is online: the green counter on the topbar opens the list of colleagues connected now with their time online; My Account › Who is online shows the sign-in time, the uptime and the last activity. Sign in with your company e-mail and password; the code of the authenticator app follows (two-factor sign-in). The first time: My Account › set your photo (it appears next to your name everywhere), your language (English, Greek, Italian, Bulgarian, Ukrainian), the theme (light / dark) and your world clocks — up to seven places for the clock strip at the top of every page (UTC is always first; Back to the company set restores the default). Passkeys (My Account › Passkeys): add this device once — your phone or PC asks for Face ID / fingerprint / PIN — and from then on the login page offers "Sign in with a passkey" (your browser may suggest it in the e-mail field), replacing password and authenticator code; a passkey is one device (or your Apple / Google keychain) bound to your account, nothing biometric leaves the device; remove it on the same page if the device is lost. The same passkey signs you in to the mobile apps (login screen › Sign in with Face ID / passkey) when the app runs in the browser or installed from the browser. 🔔 Notifications at the top is where every decision, wish and reminder arrives.',
